      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "El primer día nació Osiris, y una luz distinta cayó sobre la tierra.",
          "en": "On the first day Osiris was born, and a different light fell over the earth."
        },
        {
          "es": "En Tebas, un sacerdote que sacaba agua para el templo oyó una voz que salía del santuario.",
          "en": "In Thebes, a priest who was drawing water for the temple heard a voice coming from the shrine."
        },
        {
          "es": "La voz le ordenó gritárselo a todos: «El señor de toda la tierra ha nacido».",
          "en": "The voice told him to shout it to everyone: 'The lord of all the earth has been born.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Osiris tenía la piel verde, como las plantas que brotan, y lo llamaron el Bienhechor.",
          "en": "Osiris had green skin, like plants sprouting from the ground, and they called him the Beneficent One."
        }
      ],
