      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Osiris e Isis se casaron: eran hermanos, y se querían desde antes de nacer.",
          "en": "Osiris and Isis married: they were brother and sister, and had loved each other since before they were born."
        },
        {
          "es": "Set se casó con su hermana Neftis.",
          "en": "Set married his sister Nephthys."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mientras tanto, Geb, el dios de la tierra, ya estaba viejo y cansado.",
          "en": "Meanwhile, Geb, the god of the earth, had grown old and tired."
        },
        {
          "es": "Antes que él habían reinado Ra y Shu, y ahora le tocaba a él elegir quién seguiría.",
          "en": "Before him Ra and Shu had ruled, and now it was his turn to choose who would come next."
        },
        {
          "es": "Geb miró a sus nietos y le entregó la corona a Osiris, el mayor de todos.",
          "en": "Geb looked at his grandchildren and gave the crown to Osiris, the eldest of them all."
        }
      ],
